= Young Plan Ratified

The Young Plan is finally ratified, and with it, the main reason President Hindenburg and the reactionary establishment have humored the <span style="color: var(--spd-color);">**SPD**</span> is gone. [? if spd_in_government and dvp_in_government: If we can keep the Field Marshall calm, the cabinet may hold, otherwise our coalition partners may be ejected from government. ?] 

